---
description: Code style
alwaysApply: true
---
- Small focused files; one responsibility per module.
- TypeScript strict mode. Python type hints everywhere.
- Business logic lives in backend/app/services, not routers.
- Features talk to devices only through src/input and src/feedback abstractions.
- No dead code, no commented-out code, no fake/stubbed features presented as complete.
- Add or update tests for any backend logic you change.
